OL,3,GNEWSAJealous husband who strangled wife
OL,4,Ain bed given life sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jealous husband who strangled his
OL,7,Fwife in their bed has received a life
OL,8,Fsentence.
OL,10,FMichael Davies, 58, was found guilty of
OL,11,Fkilling Tracey Davies at their home on
OL,12,FBryn Terrace in Cefn Cribwr, Bridgend.
OL,14,FDavies wrongly suspected she was going
OL,15,Fto leave him and was jealous over his
OL,16,Fwife working with male colleagues.
OL,18,FHe previously admitted the manslaughter
OL,19,Fof Tracey, 48, but denied murder on the
OL,20,Fgrounds of diminished responsibility.
